& [ImplementedCorrespondence]
  + one SopSeed binds four distinct external trust references one shared discovery profile exactly three backend profiles one finite capability ceiling and an explicit successor policy
  + TypedSopIr binds source and canonical digests strict typed nodes exact SemanticAddress source correspondence a closed acyclic dependency graph unresolved items and fixed non-authority language
  + CandidateCompilationPlan selects exactly one attention_procedure inference_host_integration or native_artifact profile and binds inputs typed outputs verifiers rollback unresolved items and a capability subset
  + CompilerCapabilityReceipt exactly partitions a plan request into admitted and denied capabilities while expressly granting no execution authority
  + SelfAssemblyLedger records only a contiguous prefix of self_description self_ordering self_hosting and self_revision and requires independent Honesty Security external recognition and evidence before recognizing a successor
  + all six aggregate identities are domain-separated SHA-256 digests over canonical serialized content excluding only the aggregate's own digest field
  + no parser lowerer artifact generator tool invocation model call signing installation execution or effect surface was introduced

